<Project>
  <!--
    Auto-imported into the consumer csproj when this NuGet package is installed.

    The analyzer, code-fix and generator assemblies are registered by NuGet
    itself: it picks the highest `analyzers/dotnet/roslyn<major>.<minor>/cs`
    folder the consuming compiler supports and adds every assembly in it as an
    `Analyzer` item. Injecting them here as well would force one specific Roslyn
    variant to load in addition to the one NuGet selected, which duplicates the
    diagnostic IDs and can break the analyzer host.

    The file is kept as the hook for per-rule MSBuild flags or severity
    overrides.
  -->
</Project>
